---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/page.css';
---

<Layout
  title="About | Aafke Beukema"
  description="Eleven years in engineering, AI and product delivery at Monzo and Citymapper, now building small practical tools for small businesses."
>
  <main>
    <header class="masthead">
      <h1>About me</h1>
      <p class="tagline">
        {/* Placeholder: the fuller story goes here, so this page is not just a
            longer copy of the homepage. Left deliberately thin pending your prose. */}
        I spent eleven years in engineering, AI and product delivery at
        Monzo and Citymapper, shipping software that real customers
        depended on every day.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="now">
      <h2 id="now">What I do now</h2>
      <p>
        I now build the same quality of thing at a much smaller scale, for
        people who'd otherwise be stuck doing it by hand.
      </p>
      <p class="spaced">
        I'll tell you honestly if automation isn't the answer for your problem.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="contact">
      <h2 id="contact">Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        Tell me what's taking up your time and I'll tell you whether I can help.
        No charge for that conversation.
      </p>
      <p class="spaced">
        <a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@aafke.co.uk">hello@aafke.co.uk</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
